---
description: Slint UI conventions for Wijitify
globs: "**/*.slint"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Slint

- Pressed / hover / highlight feedback is pure Slint state. Do not round-trip to Rust for press visuals.
- Animations ≤ 150 ms; never gate input on animation completion.
- Keep views thin: bind to models/properties Rust updates asynchronously.
- Touch targets should be large enough for a finger on a tablet (~48 dp minimum).

```slint
// BAD — wait for Rust to show pressed
TouchArea { clicked => { root.request-press(); } }

// GOOD — local visual feedback
TouchArea {
    Rectangle { background: parent.pressed ? #334 : #222; }
    clicked => { root.navigate(); }
}
```
